            <p>
                Arthavi was built to keep your financial life private. Because we have no conflict of interest (no commissions or loans to sell), we don't need to read your emails to build a data model of your net worth. 
            </p>
            <p>
                Our promise:
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>No Gmail or SMS access required:</strong> Your inbox remains strictly under your control.</li>
